  "prefLabel": "Rev 704.03 Motor Vehicle Rentals to Foreign Missions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 704.03 Motor Vehicle Rentals to Foreign Missions. Motor vehicle rental charges incurred by foreign officials and government offices possessing a valid diplomatic tax exemption card issued by the United States Department of State or the American Institute of Taiwan shall not be taxable if authorized on the back of the card.\n\nSource. #11021, eff 1-21-16; ss by #14105, eff 10-29-24, EXPIRES: 10-29-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev700.html"
